  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\lim _{x \\rightarrow-} \\sum_{n=1}^{1000}(-1)^{n} x^{n}$\r\n$=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow-}\\left\\{-x+x^{2}-x^{3}+x^{4}+\\ldots+x^{1000}\\right\\}$\r\n$=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow \\infty}(-x) \\cdot\\left\\{\\frac{(-x)^{1000}-1}{(-x-1)}\\right\\}=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow-\\infty} \\frac{x^{1001}-x}{x+1}$\r\n$=\\lim _{x \\rightarrow-} \\frac{x^{1000}-1}{1+\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)}=+\\infty$",
    "image": null
  },
